  "description": "Seo Ji-Hyuk and Park Seong-Yeon are notorious on campus for their hostile relationship—like a sword and a shield. Seong-yeon can’t stand Ji-Hyuk, who keeps hitting on him relentlessly. Then one day, Seong-Yeon ends up taking a drunken Ji-Hyuk home, and when he suddenly tries to touch him, he slaps him...\n\n *“Seong-Yeon, why did you hit me? ...It just turns me on even more.\"*\n\nDamn it, is this guy seriously a crazy lunatic?! Seong-Yeon, who had seemed like an impenetrable shield, begins to waver.\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
